<p>Hey all! I’m in the process of opening a 3D Content &amp; Art Resources Store at <strong><a href="http://www.daz3d.com/shop/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DAZ3D<i class="fas fa-external-link-square-alt ms-1"></i></a></strong>, but while I’m waiting through the submissions and review process I could use a little paying work to get me by. So, I am taking commissions for art projects: Illustrations, Portraits, Etc., from all comers. You can message me for details if you are interested or would like a quote on a picture you’d like me to create for you.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>